{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_st_08-01",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "st_08-01",
  "title": "今日，血色满溢",
  "storyCode": "M8-1",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-01.txt",
  "sourceHash": "bbe47924e7355c194a1c89f3a5b723b80e47850f12d66bfdacad99e039518eb5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_0"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "法律，原始的法律，同态复仇的背后是同样原始的需要，对暴力的需要。\n城邦向居民许诺，用优厚的生活与稳定的环境安抚他们——\n让他们的生命服务于一个人造的目标，驯化他们天性中的征服意志，教他们安心，令他们软弱。\n我们的陛下是睿智的。\n诸多城邦将有力视作罪恶，将匮乏勇气当作美德，将畏惧死亡看作进步。陛下将撕去他们的遮羞布，让他们思考，让他们反省。\n我们人类的血脉里，一直流淌着一种渴望，一种对以行为宣泄自身生命力量的渴望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_9"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "公平不是天生的。公平是依赖有智慧、有意志的力量去缔造的。\n陛下将把他们需要的这一切，被城市带走的这一切，还给他们。\n新的目标将被宣布，陛下会重整他们被日常生活与无聊磨平的思维，唤醒他们身体里被僵化的伦理束缚多时的血性。\n暴力贯穿我们的躯体，如果我们不让它在我们的身心中自然发芽，我们将变得怨毒、渺小而麻木，也将因此招致自我的毁灭。\n常时畏惧的人是可鄙的。\n一个人想要活着，就应当被浸没在暴力之中，认清众多道德的虚伪，知晓现下大地的贫瘠。\n只有暴力才是真实的，能被感触的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_6"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不是惩罚，不是统治，不是价值的衡量与怀柔的伪饰，我们用拳头和武器告诉他们我们活着，且应当活着。只有活着的人才该活着。\n我不责怪皇帝陛下对我判下的处罚，我不识时务地侮蔑了他向民众倾诉的仁慈话语，因他舍不得他的子民轻易遭受剧烈转变的痛楚。\n就算这样，我对真理的坦述也不得停止。我必须不断地、不断地赞美陛下的真知灼见，我只能呼唤我的诚实，我不能沉默。\n事实上，我们不想要所谓正义，也不企盼安宁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_perimeter"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "目光短浅、奔走于自身利益的人才会沉湎于安宁。\n我们想要的，是动用我们血管里奔涌的暴力，我们这自文明起源处就被启发了的天性，我们奋勇挣扎和胜利的源泉。我们要使用暴力。\n一切修饰都只是正当化我们的需求，但这无关紧要。\n当我们需要，我们就当直接索求，把修饰留给历史学家和道德卫士吧，他们才需要正当性，我们的生存可比任何理论都更正当。\n我们要伤害人，战胜人，毁灭人，如果这对乌萨斯是场灾难，那我们就应该把灾难带给他人，带给乌萨斯之外的人。\n如果他们不强健，他们就该被消灭，有的人比其他人更适合生存，也更适合成就。\n软弱就是邪恶。强大就是崇高。我们的法律理当建立在健全市民的身心需求之上，我们的国家不该服务于蛆虫，也不该喂养更多病患。\n愿我所鄙夷的这些狭隘的、贪图安逸的臣民在审判后永居血湖，愿陛下带领乌萨斯走向永远的繁荣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "——异端的君主传道士在被乌萨斯皇帝判处绞刑后，走上绞架前的最后一次布道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "切尔诺伯格核心城，中央区"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "间谍！乌萨斯的间谍！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们在这！去和大伙说，他们在这！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀了他们，杀了他们！把他们挂在对接层上，把他们碾在龙门的楼上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "后撤吧，迷迭香。他们占据了整座商厦，这个街区已经被他们封锁了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我来吧。绕远路的话，我们会被其它地方的整合运动攻击的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萨卡兹......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你，看着点，那个术师......看着点！别让她动手！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把她们弄死！快点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好！好！！杀呀，杀了他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（哥伦比亚语）要杀我吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叫你们不知好歹，叫你们脖子上拴的是乌萨斯的链子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香，不值得！他们已经差不多疯了！我们换个街区，找找另外的突破口！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "拿弩枪来！拿弩枪来......把她的头，把她的头给打爆！刚才来这里的那只兔子也是......你也是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅没从这里走，是因为她不想像我这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们用什么眼神看我？你是感染者，你是感染者，你们怎么用那种眼神看我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "合作？生还？什么东西，哈哈，说什么，乌萨斯都战胜不了我们，我们赢了，赢了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "射击！打她呀，打她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没用的。我不想你伤到我，你就什么都做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么回事......怎么回事！继续打！继续打！全部轰上去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是墙吗？什么法术......什么东西！弩箭撞上去都烂了，都烂了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别打那几个墙壁似的东西，没有用！那个看着就很坚固！叫术师们来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你懂什么，我们就是对着她的脸打的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是箭射到她身上，碎片弹打到她脸上之前，就都撞上了什么东西，透明的墙还是什么，什么东西！碎了，进不去！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "垃圾术师，看你撑到什么时候......你还有多少体力？！你撑不了多久，看你撑到什么时候！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么，为什么......你们难道射不穿吗，她什么也没做啊，你们的弩炮呢，你们的赋能弩箭呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "轰炸啊，把她炸开花，炸得粉碎，炸得和该死的乌萨斯人一样，然后做成晚上的汤！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里是迷迭香小队，阿米娅！接通你了......劝劝她，你劝劝她！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香，听通讯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "穿制服的，啊哈，穿制服的，我们把你们吊死，风干在电线上，让腐毛嘴把你们啄个稀烂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让你们知道，知道看不起我们的下场！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看不起我们的，害我们的，以前给我们使脸色的，哈哈，呵，全都杀了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "全都丢进引擎里，突突突突突突，肉沫喷出来，哈哈哈哈哈......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在干什么？你怎么在这手舞足蹈？！不要暴露小队位置！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废话这么多......魔族玩意！硬角的畜生！你凭什么命令我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你当你是塔露拉，还是那个好死不死的老畜生？完了，他已经完蛋了！砰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们都得完蛋！我们乌萨斯人感染者......杀！杀了你们所有人！你们都是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萨卡兹将感染者踢下了窗口。\n感染者嚎叫着，或者说，笑着，从七楼摔落在地，紧接着被弩炮炸成了碎片。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萨卡兹雇佣兵",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "动手。把重火力武器拿出来。宰了他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，听得见吗？就从说好的路线走。通话完毕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迷迭香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "游击队现在的动向呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "侦查干员汇报说，已经集合的游击队正在中央大道上正面攻击其他整合运动守军。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有一些游击队的小队，不进反退，他们四散向城市的各个部分......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是这样的，游击队还有其他的职责。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我们这两支小队已经无暇顾及核心城内其他部分的状况了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突破封锁需要的时间越长，我们剩下的时间就越少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果其他反游击队派的感染者被游击队牵制住了，我们就能更快到达指挥塔。不能浪费这个机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对整个局势的控制，依赖Raidian和Mantra的判断。对战场的控制......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我和迷迭香都需要更多思考的空间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，迷迭香......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在我们排除了伏击干扰后，其他的迂回路线也得到了保证。但迷迭香，我想，迷迭香大概只会选择破除眼前的阻碍吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她大概已经这么做了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希医生说中了。真是一塌糊涂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动已经崩溃了，他们的自相残杀比对游击队的攻击来得还快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "平常他们自己的摩擦肯定也很多，现在爱国者死了，这个消息一下子被点爆了，然后什么都乱掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看看一路上那种惨状，我不信他们能有多团结。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通知其他小队成员，集合。让术师们收回无人机。我们去和迷迭香汇合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里已经处理好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对不起，阿米娅。我们该有更好的处理方式的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是我要这么做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交涉失败不是问题，他们那个样子，是没法交流的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是他们在做坏事，放任他们，只会发生更多坏事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整栋楼都......整栋楼你都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做得太过火了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，没有。不，只是我没和你一起出过任务。亲眼看见，很震撼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不愧是罗德岛的底牌，最强的战争机器......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（阿米娅，我说错话了？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_bridge"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "核心城行动队离舰前夕"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不会允许。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希医生。这一次，我肯定要这么做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这个问题我们探讨过很多次了，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的源石技艺耗费的是你的体力，甚至是你新陈代谢所需的生理活性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的生命在......流逝。你不是一台机器，一门舰炮，你不能更换零件，也不能被继续加工。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不。也许你还不知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......又一个太过漫长的记忆。我不确定那会给你的身体带来多大的压力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一次模拟的结果都很不理想，我还会排除这个选项。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那这样，凯尔希医生，我这么说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一次我必须这么做。我要再解开一枚戒指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，我们在探讨一种暴力。这是你对我这么说的。如果你不希望我现在阻止你，当时的你也不会让我立誓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "议长与我一同铸造这些戒指，为的就是不让后来者轻易地走上这条道路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是在使用它，凯尔希医生。我不会为武器辩护，也绝不会说哪一种能更快杀人的武器是好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，特蕾西娅小姐留给我的东西，绝对不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从最开始起，它也许就不是被当做一种武器设计出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它不该被用来杀死谁......从来都不是。在使用它时，我在想的是我应该救下谁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是我这几年和它共处得出的结论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......信任一种武器绝非明智之举。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你要把它当做手术工具而不是凶器去使用，你就得掌控它的刀刃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刀刃对敌我而言都是刀刃，无论你怎么运用，它的性质依然不会改变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅......它会割伤你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凯尔希医生，我不怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "伤口是会愈合的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是那会留下疤痕。令人不忍直视的疤痕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......呜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我......我不会放弃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "源石已经让我的身体变成那样了。再多伤口......也只是一两个伤口而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是一件武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要我再举一次那个伤人的例子吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——什么例子？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谁来证明你我不是一种武器？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是否是一种武器，这要谁来定义？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "武器会思考吗，会思考的武器会更可怕吗，拥有自我意识就不再是一种武器了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，阿米娅。我不同意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然我知道——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "你已经长大了。\n我阻止不了你。\n决定是你自己来做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_chercen_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，干员，你说错话了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你见过，嗯......那么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......可爱的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兵器......吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。不，我也不是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅......更可爱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，对不起！我想不出......想不出其他该怎么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们是人。是有喜怒哀乐的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在这之后，找个机会向她道歉吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，没有，阿米娅。没事的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧，我们一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，等等，迷迭香......我会摔倒的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_042",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要抓紧点。不能让你被那些家伙，那些感染者，不能让他们伤到你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "慢点走......我们慢点走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（也许我不该那么说的。但......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（嗯......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cherunder_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "中央区"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你看见了吗，凯尔希？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，呃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别，别靠近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看见了。任何一个视力还正常的人都不能无视这种现象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——你还记得你在龙门遭遇的特殊感染者吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一个会促使其他感染者的器官发生变异的整合运动少年感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "谁？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我记得。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_091",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅菲斯特的牧群吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么魔族也......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_091",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要，不要向前，再往里走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你干什么......我们要在前面布防的！叛徒快打到这里来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动感染者",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅菲斯特这个家伙，又在想什么？我们绕过去，他们不会攻击我们的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
